window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-078-55978535864e6185.json"]={sha256:"55978535864e6185667a2c9977467f171aafce5f64b845ae162b2137d2c92b6a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-12394b4a22706b67","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/","title":"Principles of Digital Communications I","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communications I","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-078","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-078","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-079","referenceUrls":["https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf"],"title":"OFDM 循環字首：延遲擴散與有效時間","titleEn":"OFDM cyclic prefix: delay spread and useful time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 5 % 與 10 %，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 5 % and 10 %, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋80 %與88.8888888889 %，建立ofdm_timeline.csv、通道抽頭、CP邊界圖，並完成以下驗收：第二組時間效率較高但不滿足延遲界限；選16 microsecond後仍保留定時誤差餘裕檢查。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 80 % and 88.8888888889 %; create ofdm_timeline.csv, channel taps and CP-boundary plot; apply this acceptance decision: The second case has better time efficiency but violates the delay bound; select16 microseconds and separately reserve timing margin.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 EVMrms=sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²))；須先定義參考星座及是否校正共同增益與相位。 展開基準式 sqrt(0.25/100)*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用四個等能量誤差子群加總，重現總能量；把EVM平方回去應還原0.0025及0.01。 將兩條推導一起存入 iq_energy.csv、誤差向量圖、校正設定紀錄。","從原理 理想CP-OFDM有效時間比例Tu/(Tu+Tcp)；CP必須覆蓋通道記憶與定時誤差，不能單為效率無限縮短。 展開基準式 64/(64+16)*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：逐符元畫64+16與64+8的時間軸；比較10 microsecond通道尾巴是否越過CP。 將兩條推導一起存入 ofdm_timeline.csv、通道抽頭、CP邊界圖。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from RMS EVM is sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²)); define the reference constellation and common gain/phase correction first., expand baseline expression sqrt(0.25/100)*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Sum four equal-energy error subgroups; squaring EVM as a ratio must recover0.0025 and0.01. Save both derivations with iq_energy.csv, error-vector plot and correction settings.","Starting from Ideal CP-OFDM useful-time fraction is Tu/(Tu+Tcp); CP must cover channel memory and timing error rather than simply being minimized., expand baseline expression 64/(64+16)*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Draw64+16 and64+8 symbol timelines and test whether the10 microsecond channel tail exceeds the CP. Save both derivations with ofdm_timeline.csv, channel taps and CP-boundary plot.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-088","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/recommendation-itu-r-m-2012-7-02-2026-detailed-specifications-of-the-terrestrial-radio-interfaces-of-international-mobile-telecommunications-advanced-imt-advanced"],"title":"LTE-Advanced 載波聚合：瓶頸與不等頻段","titleEn":"LTE-Advanced carrier aggregation: unequal carriers and bottlenecks","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 5 % 與 10 %，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 5 % and 10 %, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋60 Mbit/s與50 Mbit/s，建立ca_capacity.csv、各段瓶頸圖、載波啟用證據，並完成以下驗收：55 Mbit/s需求僅第一配置可行；報告回程限制而非誤稱空中介面只有60能力。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 60 Mbit/s and 50 Mbit/s; create ca_capacity.csv, bottleneck diagram and carrier-activation evidence; apply this acceptance decision: Only the first configuration meets55 Mbit/s; report a backhaul limit rather than declaring a60 Mbit/s radio limit.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 EVMrms=sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²))；須先定義參考星座及是否校正共同增益與相位。 展開基準式 sqrt(0.25/100)*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用四個等能量誤差子群加總，重現總能量；把EVM平方回去應還原0.0025及0.01。 將兩條推導一起存入 iq_energy.csv、誤差向量圖、校正設定紀錄。","從原理 聚合的有效率是各載波有效率之和，再受終端或回程瓶頸限制；不可只加頻寬宣稱同倍率增益。 展開基準式 min(40+30,60)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：畫每載波與回程三段吞吐，總流量不得超過任一共享瓶頸；核對同一時間窗。 將兩條推導一起存入 ca_capacity.csv、各段瓶頸圖、載波啟用證據。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from RMS EVM is sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²)); define the reference constellation and common gain/phase correction first., expand baseline expression sqrt(0.25/100)*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Sum four equal-energy error subgroups; squaring EVM as a ratio must recover0.0025 and0.01. Save both derivations with iq_energy.csv, error-vector plot and correction settings.","Starting from Aggregate goodput sums carrier goodput then meets UE/backhaul bottlenecks; adding bandwidth alone does not establish proportional speedup., expand baseline expression min(40+30,60); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Draw the two carriers and shared backhaul; total flow cannot exceed a shared bottleneck and all rates need one time window. Save both derivations with ca_capacity.csv, bottleneck diagram and carrier-activation evidence.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-0e90e3978e42dfde","url":"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/138200_138299/138211/19.02.00_60/ts_138211v190200p.pdf","title":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","titleEn":"ETSI TS 138 211 V19.2.0: NR physical channels and modulation","publisher":"ETSI / 3GPP","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-54c0b2f5304c0c3c","url":"https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/recommendation-itu-r-m-2012-7-02-2026-detailed-specifications-of-the-terrestrial-radio-interfaces-of-international-mobile-telecommunications-advanced-imt-advanced","title":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","titleEn":"ITU-R M.2012-7: LTE-Advanced radio-interface specification","publisher":"ITU","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
